### Create transaction
POST http://localhost:3000/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "ACC-12345",
  "toAccount": "ACC-67890",
  "amount": 100.50,
  "currency": "USD",
  "type": "transfer"
}

### List all transactions
GET http://localhost:3000/transactions

### Filter transactions by account
GET http://localhost:3000/transactions?accountId=ACC-12345

### Filter transactions by type
GET http://localhost:3000/transactions?type=transfer

### Filter transactions by date range
GET http://localhost:3000/transactions?from=2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z&to=2026-12-31T23:59:59.999Z

### Get transaction by id (replace with real id)
GET http://localhost:3000/transactions/replace-with-transaction-id

### Get account balance
GET http://localhost:3000/accounts/ACC-12345/balance

### Get account summary (additional feature)
GET http://localhost:3000/accounts/ACC-12345/summary
